          :statement "The three equations aif-equations.edn gives R5 are transcribed correctly and now run under a gate -- but the only implementation of them in this tree is a harness, and the R5 the machine ships computes a different object. The registry's R5 is risk = D_KL[Q(o|pi) || C] over a distribution on a declared outcome alphabet; the live R5 is a weighted sum of per-channel Gaussian KLs over 13 declared channel ranges, and its ambiguity is a sum of per-channel Gaussian entropies. Neither can consume a distribution over the six declared outcomes, and none of the three registry rows carries a :code field naming a call path."
