   ["THE OPERATIONAL CHECK HOLDS, AND IT IS THE FIRST IN THE SWEEP THAT DOES. docs/futon-aif-completeness.md:179 asks: 'Find where Pi is updated. Verify it is updated tick-over-tick.' The update is at src/futon2/aif/precision.clj:160-193, the carry-in reads the previous record's :precision-state at scripts/futon2/report/war_machine.clj:6064-6066, the call is at :6132-6134 and the emission at :6229. MEASURED OVER THE WHOLE CORPUS RATHER THAN ARGUED: 6526 consecutive channel-pairs, ZERO violations of the carry relation, 2469 of them non-trivial carries with real overlap and a real append (receipt :production-M5b). R1's two clauses both failed (slice 4) and R3's required a per-tick VFE that was removed (slice 5); R7's holds."
    "THE THREE-VALUED INPUT TYPING IS HONOURED. A prediction-error field that is absent is classified rather than silently zeroed: precision.clj:57-67 returns :malformed when the record declares :producer-contract :prediction-error/v1 and :legacy-era when it does not, the coerced value is 0.0, and the classification is kept on the returned channel-state under :input-status. Both reasons exercised, both plants caught."
